# Alterac Mountains - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics, manuals and formulas whose SOURCE
# is physically in Alterac Mountains, verified against the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Twenty-two recipes are
# vendor-sold in-zone; four more drop each from an in-zone mob and (almost)
# nowhere else. Every other Alterac-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone
# world drop, and in-zone recipes sold only by Horde-faction vendors are
# excluded with reasons (see docs/alterac-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Quest records carry no reward data, so no
# quest-reward recipe ships. Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's
# own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its profession;
# other characters skip it cleanly. Fishing has no Alterac source, so it is
# stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/alterac-recipes
title Alterac Mountains - Recipes & Patterns
levels 30-40
zone Alterac Mountains
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords alterac, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Tailoring — the far south (Zixil)

  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 3537 -- Zixil (53.6, 98.7), Merchant Supreme
  buy 5772 "Pattern: Red Woolen Bag"
  note Zixil also works the Hillsbrad side; this is his Alterac point. Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

